  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Government Information and Communications Technology Modernization, through Astro Systems, Inc.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A USTDA grant for the Fiji Department of Information Technology and Computing Services is funding technical assistance to provide a roadmap to guide modernization of government digital infrastructure and workforce development in Fiji. The Project will benefit the Government of Fiji by increasing efficiency, resilience, and accessibility in public service delivery, reducing operational risks, and improving data security.</narrative>
